## Usage

Start the app from the project root:

```bash
uv run poe run
```

This is `streamlit run app.py`. Streamlit serves the app locally and prints its
address. `poe check` never starts the server: the tests drive the app in process.

## Project structure

```text
app.py                            Launcher run by `streamlit run`
src/{{ project.package_name }}/   Package source, including the app
tests/                            Test suite
.streamlit/config.toml            Streamlit configuration
```

Add a `pages/` directory next to `app.py` to give the app more views; Streamlit
lists each file in it in the sidebar.

`.streamlit/secrets.toml` is Streamlit's own secret file. Git ignores it, so never
commit it or copy its contents into a tracked file.
